E_{\mathrm{time}}
+
E_{\mathrm{operating}}
+
E_{\mathrm{tail}}.$ This is a reconstruction, not a formal equation from the interview. It keeps the categories separate: capital at risk, years of attention, operating responsibility, and severe events attached to the business.

